There is no light in passeways as well as in some rooms.
And when there's no light, you can only see what's next to you.
When there's light, you can see far, far away (even a lit area behind an
unlit one, as you may have notice with rooms separated by a straight
corridor).

As already mentionned, there are lots of light source you may want to use
in the dungeon.

Yes, you're pet only follow you up/downstair if it's standing next to you
when you go up/down (and can move, ie not paralysed, sleeping, eating or
something else).

